ease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nOfficer Wang is in charge of investigating a complex theft case. Based on preliminary investigations, he suspects Mr. Li. However, Mr. Li is a well-known figure in the town and has close ties with his political friends. Although Officer Wang never interacts with Mr. Li, Officer Wang knows that if he directly accuses Mr. Li, it possibly causes unnecessary trouble. Therefore, he decides to hide his suspicions and writes in the report that the case is still under further investigation and the suspect is not yet determined.\n\n[Question]\nWhy does Officer Wang say this?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Officer Wang thinks Mr. Li does a lot of good things in the town and does not believe he is a thief.\nB. Officer Wang says this because he wants to cover up his suspicion of Mr. Li, avoid conflict with Mr. Li's political friends, and protect his career from unnecessary impact.\nC. Officer Wang says this because he fears Mr. Li's retaliation and worries about the safety of himself and his family.\nD. Officer Wang has a personal relationship with Mr. Li, he does not want to ruin their friendship.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.006692585767314716,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af52ba2c2ddb05a7fe30d80","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794452386770,"createTime":"2026-11-12 10:59:46","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"99ed3c7a5a3443029bbd814b55c48e67"}